Buffer_Toggle_Label VSync
User_Interface_Scale_Field_Label UI Scale
UseTargetFrameRate_Toggle_Label Limit Framerate
TargetFrameRate_Field_Label Max Framerate
UseUnfocusedTargetFrameRate_Toggle_Label Limit Framerate While Alt-Tabbing
UnfocusedTargetFrameRate_Field_Label Max Framerate While Alt-Tabbing

Fullscreen_Mode_Label Fullscreen Mode
Fullscreen_Mode_Exclusive Exclusive
Fullscreen_Mode_Borderless Borderless
Fullscreen_Mode_Windowed Windowed

// подсказки (HelpWindow справа) и заголовки разделов
Resolutions_Header RESOLUTIONS
User_Interface_Scale_Field_Help Interface size: 1 is normal, higher is bigger.
TargetFrameRate_Field_Help Maximum frames per second when the limit is on.
UnfocusedTargetFrameRate_Field_Help Maximum frames per second while the game is minimized.
Fullscreen_Mode_Help How the game uses the screen: exclusive fullscreen, a borderless window or a regular window.
Buffer_Toggle_Help Syncs frames to the monitor refresh rate: no screen tearing, but slightly more input lag. While on, the framerate limit is ignored.
UseTargetFrameRate_Toggle_Help Caps frames per second so your PC runs cooler and quieter. The menu is capped at 60 anyway.
UseUnfocusedTargetFrameRate_Toggle_Help A separate framerate limit while minimized. Off: at most 30 while minimized.
